  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Policy socialt skydd</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social protection policy - Social policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja etableringen av ett system f&#xf6;r barns- och familjers skydd och r&#xe4;ttigheter. Projeket &#xe4;r ett samarbete mellan de stora internat. givarna i Moldavien och den moldaviska regeringen, inom ramen f&#xf6;r &quot;Family and Child Protection Task Force&quot; och &quot;National Council for the Protection of Child Rights&quot;. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att genomf&#xf6;ra aktiviteterna i &quot;Concept Paper on Child and Family Social Protection&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to support the establishment of a child/family protection system. The project is based on cooperation between the big internt. donors in Moldova and the Moldovan Government, within the framwork of &quot;Family/Child Protection Task Force&quot; och &quot;National Council for the Protection of Child Rights&quot;. The objective is to implement the activities in the &quot;Concept Paper on Child/Family Social Protection&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
